# Images
*.png
*.pdf
*.svg
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.tiff
# The docs ship their own images, and the blanket ignore above drops them silently: the build
# still succeeds locally off the working tree, so the loss only shows up as broken images on the
# published site. Keep the whole static dir exempt rather than naming files one at a time.
!docs/_static/*.png
!docs/_static/*.svg
!assets/readme/*.png
!assets/readme/*.gif

